  "description": "Reader for the OLE2 / Compound File Binary (CFB) container format - the structured-storage envelope used by legacy Microsoft Office files such as .xls, .doc, .ppt, and .msg. Navigates the storage hierarchy, exposes per-entry metadata (class id, state bits, time stamps), materializes named streams, and parses OLE property sets (summary information) - without any application-format knowledge.",
